            <p style="font-size: 15px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); margin: 0;">Skip kiosk lines at the airport. Airalo gives you instant 4G/5G data from $8.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.airalo.com/morocco-esim" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="roam-btn-black">
            Get Morocco eSIM →
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2>
          3. The Best Months for Cheap Morocco Flights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Flight prices to Morocco follow distinct seasonal waves:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cheapest Months (Low Season):</strong> Mid-January through February, and June through early July. Fares drop significantly.</li>
          <li><strong>The Sweet Spot (Shoulder Season):</strong> Late October, November, and March offer pleasant desert temperatures and moderate flight fares.</li>
          <li><strong>Peak Expensive Weeks:</strong> Christmas & New Year's week, Easter holidays, and mid-April through May. If traveling during these periods, book at least 90–120 days in advance.</li>
        </ul>

              <!-- Roam Morocco E-E-A-T Curator Bio Card -->
      <div class="roam-author-card" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
        <div class="roam-author-avatar">RM</div>
        <div class="roam-author-content">
